# Gifting Catalogue — Project Overview

Plain static HTML/CSS/JS corporate gifting catalog. **No build step, no framework.**

## Branding
- Company name: **Gifting Catalogue**
- Logo initials: **GC**
- Do not reintroduce "GiftForge" naming

## Structure
```
index.html, about.html, contact.html   # root pages
categories/*.html                      # one page per category slug
css/styles.css                         # all styles + responsive breakpoints
js/main.js                           # nav, rendering, modal, forms
js/icons.js                          # SVG category icons via renderCategoryIcon()
data/products.js                     # CATEGORIES + PRODUCTS (single source of truth)
```

## Key patterns
- Header/footer injected by `main.js` into `[data-site-header]` and `[data-site-footer]`
- Category pages use `body data-page="category" data-category="<slug>"`
- Root pages use `data-page="home" | "about" | "contact"`
- Icons are SVG only — never emojis for categories or UI chrome

## Constraints
- Do not add npm/build tooling unless explicitly requested
- Do not start a dev server — user runs it themselves
- Keep changes minimal and match existing patterns
- Contact form is client-side demo only (no backend)

## Deployment
- GitHub: `dybydx/html-catalog`
- Cloudflare Pages project: `html-catalog` → https://html-catalog.pages.dev
- Deploy: `wrangler pages deploy . --project-name=html-catalog --branch=main`
